          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "What the name server (`ns.rec.net`) returns: the base URL of every other RecNet service.\nField names are those of the client's `RecNet.Core.NameServerResponse` class; the client deserialises them\ncase-sensitively, so do not rename."
